<title>BRAZIL: Marco Polo 1996 net income rises 33 percent.</title>
<headline>Marco Polo 1996 net income rises 33 percent.</headline>
<dateline>CAXIAS DO SUL, Brazil 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ending  Dec. 31, 1996</p>
<p>			  1996			 1995</p>
<p> per 1,000 Shr   $  26.96		 $   20.18</p>
<p> Net		   22,100		    16,600</p>
<p> Revs		  293,300		   260,200</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net income and net revenue figures for 1996 are consolidated; net income and net revenue figures for 1995 are adjusted.</p>
<p>The company announced cash dividends of $7.00 per lot of 1,000 shares to be distributed February 25.</p>
<p>Share figures reflect earnings per 1,000 shares.</p>
</text>
